Package: ModuleViz
Title: Longitudinal Omics Heatmaps and Temporal Module Plots
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Hua", "Huang", email = "helenhuang.math@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Cluster longitudinal omics features into temporal modules, draw
    ordered ComplexHeatmap heatmaps, summarize module trajectories, test
    modules for gene-set enrichment, and align paired omics layers such as RNA
    and ATAC by gene. Bulk matrices, SummarizedExperiment objects, and
    single-cell data (SingleCellExperiment or Seurat objects, summarized into
    pseudobulk profiles) are supported.
biocViews: Software, GeneExpression, Transcriptomics, RNASeq, SingleCell,
    Epigenetics, TimeCourse, Clustering, GeneSetEnrichment, Visualization
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/helenhuangmath/ModuleViz
BugReports: https://github.com/helenhuangmath/ModuleViz/issues
